# Allowlist: ignore everything, then explicitly allow what should be tracked.
# Keep this small. Add a `!` rule only when a needed file is being ignored.
*
!*/

# Code
!*.go
!go.mod
!go.sum

# Documentation
!*.md
!LICENSE
!docs/screenshots/*.png

# Repo config
!.gitignore
!.github/**

# Install scripts
!install.sh
!install.ps1

# Test fixtures
!**/testdata/**
